{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 6, "ref": "2-kings 10:6", "book": "2-kings", "lang": "sv", "chapter": 10, "translation": "Ond han skrev ⟨את⟩ dem ett brev för andra gången och sade: Om ni ⟨är⟩ mina och om ni lyssnar på min röst, tag ⟨את⟩ huvudena av männen, er herres söner, och kom till mig vid denna tid i morgon ⟨till⟩ Jizreel. Och kungens söner, sjuttio man, ⟨var⟩ hos ⟨את⟩ de stora i staden, de som uppfödde dem.", "tokens": [{"surface": "ויכתב", "gloss": "och skrev"}, {"surface": "אליהם", "gloss": "till dem"}, {"surface": "ספר", "gloss": "ett brev"}, {"surface": "שנית", "gloss": "för andra gången"}, {"surface": "לאמר", "gloss": "och sade"}, {"surface": "אם", "gloss": "om"}, {"surface": "לי", "gloss": "mina"}, {"surface": "אתם", "gloss": "ni"}, {"surface": "ולקלי", "gloss": "och på min röst"}, {"surface": "אתם", "gloss": "ni"}, {"surface": "שמעים", "gloss": "lyssnar"}, {"surface": "קחו", "gloss": "tag"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "huvudena av männen, er herres söner"}, {"surface": "ראשי", "gloss": "huvudena"}, {"surface": "אנשי", "gloss": "av männen"}, {"surface": "בני", "gloss": "söner"}, {"surface": "אדניכם", "gloss": "er herre"}, {"surface": "ובאו", "gloss": "och kom"}, {"surface": "אלי", "gloss": "till mig"}, {"surface": "כעת", "gloss": "vid denna tid"}, {"surface": "מחר", "gloss": "i morgon"}, {"surface": "יזרעאלה", "gloss": "till Jizreel"}, {"surface": "ובני", "gloss": "och söner(till)"}, {"surface": "המלך", "gloss": "kungen"}, {"surface": "שבעים", "gloss": "sjuttio"}, {"surface": "איש", "gloss": "man"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "de stora i staden"}, {"surface": "גדלי", "gloss": "de stora"}, {"surface": "העיר", "gloss": "staden"}, {"surface": "מגדלים", "gloss": "uppfödde"}, {"surface": "אותם", "gloss": "⟨את⟩ dem"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:36:12.953253998Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}